        "hitHome": "Ahab could gather four hundred voices telling him what he wanted, but he couldn't change what God had said; we can do the same with the podcasts, friends, and feeds we choose. Micaiah reminds us that faithfulness sometimes means being the one unwelcome voice in the room. And no disguise protects us from God's word — but it also means no circumstance is truly random when God is at work.",
